scene.metamechanica.animadversion.receive.challenge.0=A tiny hole had been gnawed into the wall. Just for a moment, but you saw these subtle streams of data, the underbelly of the world. And by the time the signal from your eyes reached your brain, the window was already tightly closed. It's on the tip of your tongue...
scene.metamechanica.animadversion.receive.challenge.1=For a brief moment, you thought your tired head had collected together what it had been processing in the background since you first entered the world. However, the feeling disappeared as soon as you gave it a name.
scene.metamechanica.animadversion.receive.challenge.2=Something in the endlessly branching cave systems stirs, resisting. Plaster crumbles from the blue vault. The winch that moves the sun is hopelessly outdated and completely worn out.